    "AI-proposed shell/test commands are advisory data only; execution uses repository-owned fixed commands",
    "AI patches are applied only in isolated Git worktrees/branches and never directly to the main worktree",
    "Protected safety, verification, reconciliation, operations kill-switch, storage, credential, and runtime paths cannot be modified by an AI repair patch",
